our enemies and restore your shield. The more shield strength you have at the end of the level, the higher your score - If you can last that long!\n\n", "short_description": "\u201cI love this game\u201d\n-Twisted VR\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s wonderful\u2026there\u2019s no other game like it.\u201d\n-Gear VR News\n\n\u201c\u2026you\u2019ll have a blast with Mega Spacehole.\u201d\n-VR Giant\n\nObliterate the enemy with your mighty gaze. Dominate each arena with the mere turn of your head. Master every level and become the Mega Spacehole you were meant to be. \n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.megaspacehole.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.megaspacehole.com/", "publisher_name": "Furious Union", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.megaspacehole.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ARCADE", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "485791169585186"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12138836_784339765027905_1065375798_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hBy9WTNI9NwQ7kNvwH04MRG&_nc_oc=AdqQQIpqvq8Hc34lqJIgl-Pm2pAaEUN9qxXpeto55_zG5cP1p_2DqLLQFpGh35IDT3U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0hNUqfRHaG01G6Rg1Yk7CYCIKj4Blx_ekLqftgBvOXog&oe=69F208A4"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Mega Spacehole", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "